## Tool used

Manual Review

## Recommendation
Auction.sol:
```diff
function _revertIfLotConcluded(uint96 lotId_) internal view virtual {
        // Beyond the conclusion time
-        if (lotData[lotId_].conclusion < uint48(block.timestamp)) {
+        if (lotData[lotId_].conclusion <= uint48(block.timestamp)) {
            revert Auction_MarketNotActive(lotId_);
        }

